.build/
Deps/
*.resolved

# The swiftly installer is a download, not a source artifact — README.md curls
# it. A copy got committed by running that curl inside the repo; don't again.
swiftly.pkg

# The spike's wasm is an 82 MB build output nothing depends on. Render serves
# ../web/dist (render.yaml: staticPublishPath), NOT this directory — the spike
# was only ever the proof of concept, so the note that used to live here about
# committing dist/ for Render applies to web/.gitignore, not this one. The
# html/JS glue stays tracked so the bundle is still readable; rebuild the wasm
# with ./build.sh if you want to run the spike locally.
dist/*.wasm
